  "interpretation": {
    "sharing": "Transfers to service providers acting on KORLIX behalf and explicit user-initiated transfers/prominent consent use Google sharing exceptions. OpenAI still receives enabled AI requests. This is not a claim that no data leaves KORLIX.",
    "ephemeral": "Account/saved data persists. No end-to-end zero-retention assertion was verified for every AI and platform speech provider. Raw call recording storage by KORLIX is not asserted.",
    "optional": "Voice, AI content, files and purchases are user-initiated; required identity/security/operational event collection lacks an in-app opt-out.",
